F. MUTUAL CANCELLATION

A single participant must not be able to claim mutual
cancellation.

Define a mechanism that records one party's request and
requires the other party's independent authorization.

Define:
- Who may initiate.
- Who must confirm.
- Whether cancellation is possible during fulfilment review.
- Whether it is prohibited after approval.
- What happens if the second party never responds.

G. FULFILMENT REJECTION

The previous plan says rejection causes a refund but does
